---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout pageId="projects">
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container page-hero__grid">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Student projects</span><h1>Propose a student project.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">Students may submit ideas. Members will decide what to support after reviewing the budget, workspace, tools, supervision, and safety requirements.</p><div class="page-hero__actions"><a class="button button--primary" href="#propose">Submit a project idea</a><a class="button button--secondary" href="join?interest=projects">Submit project interest</a></div></div>
    <div class="page-hero__side"><figure class="page-hero__figure"><img src="assets/images/photos/motherboard-macro.jpg" width="1200" height="960" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" alt="A macro view of components across a motherboard"></figure><aside class="page-hero__aside"><strong>When a project is selected</strong><p>Its brief will name the scope, lead, team, resources, and first milestone.</p></aside></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Selection criteria</span><h2>Members will choose the first projects.</h2></div><p>Proposals will be reviewed for their value to a 3-2 application, usefulness on campus, cost, workspace, tools, supervision, and safety.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2">
      <article class="card"><h3>Useful for a 3-2 application</h3><p>Will the work produce a design, prototype, code, measurements, test results, or another result a student can explain?</p></article>
      <article class="card"><h3>Useful on campus</h3><p>Who at Oberlin would use the result, and what problem would it address?</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Selected projects</span><h2>Project briefs.</h2></div><p>Approved projects appear here with their scope, lead, team, budget, workspace, and first milestone.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--2" id="project-grid" data-project-grid><div class="empty-state"><h3>No projects selected</h3><p>Members will choose the first projects after reviewing proposals and available resources.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">Technical areas</span><h2>Areas members could work in.</h2></div><p>These are categories of work, not approved projects.</p></div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid--4">
      <article class="card"><span class="card__number">Testing</span><h3>Electronics testing</h3><p>Measurement, circuit assembly, power checks, and test records.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card__number">Hardware</span><h3>Embedded systems</h3><p>Sensors, microcontrollers, and physical computing.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card__number">Software</span><h3>Control software</h3><p>Interfaces, automation, visualization, and data logging for prototypes.</p></article>
      <article class="card"><span class="card__number">Machines</span><h3>Robotics</h3><p>Motors, sensors, mechanisms, and control.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="propose">
  <div class="container split">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">Propose a project</span><h2>Describe the problem and a first test.</h2><p>Include who the work is for, what you would build first, and any tools, workspace, or safety needs you already know about.</p><div class="callout"><p><strong>You can submit an idea without a team.</strong> Submitting an idea does not guarantee selection or funding.</p></div></div>
    <form class="form-shell" data-o32-form data-form-type="project_idea">
      <h3>Project idea form</h3><p>Submissions will be reviewed when members choose the first projects.</p>
      <div class="form-grid">
        <label class="form-field"><span>Your name</span><input type="text" name="full_name" autocomplete="name" maxlength="120" required></label>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Oberlin email</span><input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" maxlength="254" required></label>
        <label class="form-field form-field--full"><span>What problem do you want to explore?</span><textarea name="problem" maxlength="1800" required></textarea></label>
        <label class="form-field form-field--full"><span>What could a small first prototype test?</span><textarea name="first_test" maxlength="1800" required></textarea></label>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Skills or tools you may need</span><input type="text" name="skills_needed" maxlength="300" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <label class="form-field"><span>Your current experience</span><select name="experience"><option value="new">New to this area</option><option value="some">Some related experience</option><option value="experienced">Comfortable leading part of it</option></select></label>
        <label class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">Company<input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label>
        <div class="form-actions"><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Submit project idea</button><p class="form-status" data-form-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
        <p class="form-note">Please do not submit private, medical, financial, or export-controlled information.</p>
      </div>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
</Layout>
